# Facts about Professor Vey.

@fact vey.illusion
tier: surface
text: Teaches Illusion & Glamour and grades on whether you fooled her.

@fact vey.tests
tier: personal
hint: Expect a question in a corridor.
unlock: seen(vey_pop_quiz) > 0
text: She tests students in corridors, unannounced, with tea that isn't there. She keeps score.

@fact vey.revue
tier: personal
hint: Ask about the faculty revue.
unlock: seen(vey_revue) > 0
text: She produces the faculty revue every year, and has never once let Professor Thorne refuse a part.

@fact vey.mirror
tier: personal
hint: Ask why she never uses the mirror charm.
unlock: seen(vey_trust) > 0
text: She doesn't use the mirror charm in public. Once, her reflection didn't come back for a week.

@fact vey.smell
tier: personal
hint: Bake something false in her class.
unlock: seen(illu_bread_smell) > 0
text: She teaches that sight is easy to fool; smell is where liars are caught.

@fact vey.own_face
tier: personal
hint: Change one small thing about yourself, in her class.
unlock: seen(illu_one_small_change) > 0
text: She has every student glamour their own face first: a glamour you can't hold on yourself, she says, won't hold on anyone.
